rounded text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"94\">Acompañamiento Académico</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"p-10\" data-kid=\"95\">\n            <h3 class=\"font-epilogue text-3xl font-bold mb-4\" data-kid=\"96\">El Diario de Lucas</h3>\n            <p class=\"font-chivo text-lg text-[var(--color-slate)]/60\" data-kid=\"97\">\"ITER me permitió centralizar las reflexiones de mis alumnos en un solo lugar, elevando la calidad de mi feedback en un 40%.\"</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"min-w-[72%] md:min-w-[45%] bg-white rounded-[32px] overflow-hidden shadow-lg group\" data-kid=\"98\">\n          <div class=\"h-[400px] relative\" data-kid=\"99\">\n            <video src=\"https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/37515281/15893840_360_640_25fps.mp4\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://images.pexels.com/videos/37515281/cycling-fitness-training-gym-gym-training-37515281.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&fit=crop&h=1200&w=630\" data-kid=\"100\"></video>\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[var(--color-slate)]/60 to-transparent\" data-kid=\"101\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 left-8 text-white\" data-kid=\"102\">\n              <span class=\"bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md px-3 py-1 rounded text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"103\">Centro de Alto Rendimiento</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"p-10\" data-kid=\"104\">\n            <h3 class=\"font-epilogue text-3xl font-bold mb-4\" data-kid=\"105\">Metodología Power</h3>\n            <p class=\"font-chivo text-lg text-[var(--color-slate)]/60\" data-kid=\"106\">Seguimiento biométrico y de carga en tiempo real para deportistas de élite que no pueden dejar nada al azar.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"min-w-[72%] md:min-w-[45%] bg-white rounded-[32px] overflow-hidden shadow-lg group\" data-kid=\"107\">\n          <div class=\"h-[400px] relative\" data-kid=\"108\">\n            <video src=\"https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/6326847/6326847-sd_640_338_25fps.mp4\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://images.pexels.com/videos/6326847/generation-z-indoor-man-young-6326847.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&fit=crop&h=630&w=1200\" data-kid=\"109\"></video>\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[var(--color-slate)]/60 to-transparent\" data-kid=\"110\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 left-8 text-white\" data-kid=\"111\">\n              <span class=\"bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md px-3 py-1 rounded text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"112\">Mentoring Corporativo</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"p-10\" data-kid=\"113\">\n            <h3 class=\"font-epilogue text-3xl font-bold mb-4\" data-kid=\"114\">Liderazgo 2.0</h3>\n            <p class=\"font-chivo text-lg text-[var(--color-slate)]/60\" data-kid=\"115\">Cómo una firma de consultoría utiliza ITER para guiar el crecimiento de sus directivos de forma estructurada.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    \n    <section class=\"py-40 px-12 bg-white/30\" id=\"how-it-works\" data-kid=\"116\">\n      <div class=\"max-w-[1440px] mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-20\" data-kid=\"117\">\n        <div data-kid=\"118\">\n          <span class=\"text-[var(--color-accent)] font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-sm\" data-kid=\"119\">El Método</span>\n          <h2 class=\"font-epilogue text-6xl font-bold mt-6 leading-tight\" data-kid=\"120\">Construye sobre cimientos sólidos.</h2>\n          <p class=\"font-chivo text-xl text-[var(--color-slate)]/60 mt-8 max-w-lg leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"121\">\n            Hemos destilado años de experiencia en acompañamiento para crear un flujo de trabajo que se siente natural pero es profundamente técnico.\n          </p>\n          <div class=\"mt-12\" data-kid=\"122\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-3 font-bold text-lg group\" data-kid=\"123\">\n              Ver documentación técnica \n              <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-right transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-2\" data-kid=\"124\"></i>\n            </a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"relative space-y-[-48px]\" data-kid=\"125\">\n          \n          <div class=\"staircase-item relative bg-white p-12 rounded-[40px] shadow-premium z-10 border border-[var(--color-slate)]/5 hover:-translate-y-2 transition-[transform,shadow] duration-500\" data-kid=\"126\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-start gap-10\" data-kid=\"127\">\n              <div class=\"w-20 h-20 shrink-0 bg-[var(--color-accent)]/10 text-[var(--color-accent)] flex items-center justify-center rounded-3xl text-3xl font-black\" data-kid=\"128\">01</div>\n              <div data-kid=\"129\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-epilogue text-2xl font-bold mb-4\" data-kid=\"130\">Arquitectura de Datos</h4>\n                <p class=\"font-chivo text-[var(--color-slate)]/50 leading-relaxed text-lg\" data-kid=\"131\">Define qué importa. Configura KPIs personalizados, desde niveles de cortisol hasta horas de lectura profunda.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"staircase-item relative bg-white p-12 rounded-[40px] shadow-premium z-20 border border-[var(--color-slate)]/5 hover:-translate-y-2 transition-[transform,shadow] duration-500\" data-kid=\"132\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-start gap-10\" data-kid=\"133\">\n              <div class=\"w-20 h-20 shrink-0 bg-[var(--color-accent)]/10 text-[var(--color-accent)] flex items-center justify-center rounded-3xl text-3xl font-black\" data-kid=\"134\">02</div>\n              <div data-kid=\"135\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-epilogue text-2xl font-bold mb-4\" data-kid=\"136\">Alistamiento Digital</h4>\n                <p class=\"font-chivo text-[var(--color-slate)]/50 leading-relaxed text-lg\" data-kid=\"137\">Tu espacio, tus reglas. Despliega un \"tenant\" privado en minutos con tu propia identidad visual y dominios.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"staircase-item relative bg-white p-12 rounded-[40px] shadow-[0_50px_100px_-20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.15)] z-30 border border-[var(--color-slate)]/5 hover:-translate-y-2 transition-[transform,shadow] duration-500\" data-kid=\"138\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-start gap-10\" data-kid=\"139\">\n              <div class=\"w-20 h-20 shrink-0 bg-[var(--color-accent)]/10 text-[var(--color-accent)] flex items-center justify-center rounded-3xl text-3xl font-black\" data-kid=\"140\">03</div>\n              <div data-kid=\"141\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-epilogue text-2xl font-bold mb-4\" data-kid=\"142\">Escalado Editorial</h4>\n                <p class=\"font-chivo text-[var(--color-slate)]/50 leading-relaxed text-lg\" data-kid=\"143\">Transforma datos en narrativa. Utiliza nuestros motores de insights para generar reportes que impacten.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    \n    <section class=\"py-40 px-12\" id=\"benefits\" data-kid=\"144\">\n      <div class=\"max-w-[1000px] mx-auto text-center mb-24\" data-kid=\"145\">\n        <h2 class=\"font-epilogue text-5xl font-bold mb-8\" data-kid=\"146\">Por qué los mejores eligen ITER</h2>\n        <p class=\"font-chivo text-xl text-[var(--color-slate)]/60 max-w-2xl mx-auto\" data-kid=\"147\">\n          No es solo software, es una ventaja competitiva diseñada para el largo plazo.\n